# Paths exempt from the central CI's file-size check, one per line,
# relative to the repository root, each with a `# reason` on the same line.
# Repo-owned: sync never touches this file.
src/packages/core/src/identity.rs # the pinned extension manifest key is one 392-char base64 literal by contract: .gitleaks.toml anchors on that single literal and the single-definition-site scan in scripts/check-extension-id.ts matches it whole, so splitting it breaks both
